        "TileImage": "$($repository f7637fa3-3389-4409-964c-2d94f5e19728).Image",
        "Description": "Our client is Sheikh Al-Ghazali himself. The Sheikh has been tipped off that key individuals amongst his staff have been bribed by a jealous relative in an attempt to disrupt the opening of the Burj, his greatest achievement.\r\rThese individuals must be eliminated before they can carry out their sabotage. Furthermore, the Sheikh has requested that the manner of each execution be proportional to the traitor&apos;s position (with a particularly violent end reserved for his personal helicopter pilot).",
